OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry throughout the
OL,6,Fdaytime with some good sunny spells
OL,7,Fbetween patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,8,FChance of the odd shower for Argyll.
OL,9,FModerate winds, but occasionally fresh
OL,10,Faround Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with clear spells at
OL,13,Ffirst. Turning cloudy this evening as
OL,14,Fa few outbreaks of rain spread
OL,15,Fnortheast through the night. Rather
OL,16,Fwindy around coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
