OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FPartly cloudy with a few
OL,6,Fshowers at first. Then dry and bright
OL,7,Ffor a time, but turning cloudier with
OL,8,Frain and strengthening winds in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fand breezy with variable cloud amounts
OL,13,Fand a few showers on Saturday.
OL,14,FCloudier with occasional rain on
OL,15,FSunday and Monday, especially across
OL,16,FArgyll
